# T_SCRE: the filter search, starting on the category field: its pick
# list left with Esc, which keeps the form open; by category, by
# category and location, a text with no match among them,
# and Ctrl-F in a result list opening a new search, which Esc leaves at once
# though a text was typed.
K F4 ESC
K F4 DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER CTRL-S
S FILTER
K ESC TAB
T a2
K CTRL-S
S FILTLOC
K ESC TAB TAB TAB
T zzz
K CTRL-S
S NONE
K CTRL-F
S CTRLFNEW
T abc
K ESC
